{"title":"Brigand","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 20 Bandit that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 1 times (2.2% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/cutthroats-hone\">Cutthroats Hone</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>, <a href=\"#/item/pirates-windlass\">Pirates Windlass</a> <span class=\"muted\">(archers only; rerolls quality)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/brigand\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/brigand?lv=16\">Lv 16 <span>13</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/brigand?lv=17\">Lv 17 <span>33</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/brigand?lv=18\">Lv 18 <span>10</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/brigand?lv=20\">Lv 20 <span>10</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/brigand?lv=21\">Lv 21 <span>12</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/brigand?lv=22\">Lv 22 <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/brigand?lv=23\">Lv 23 <span>7</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/brigand?lv=16\" title=\"Pick level 16\"><td><b>16</b></td><td>50</td><td>13.3</td><td>800</td><td class=\"muted\">150 · 18.6 · 2,400</td><td>13</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/brigand?lv=17\" title=\"Pick level 17\"><td><b>17</b></td><td>54</td><td>13.9</td><td>850</td><td class=\"muted\">162 · 19.5 · 2,550</td><td>33</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Haunted%20Cavern\">Haunted Cavern</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/brigand?lv=18\" title=\"Pick level 18\"><td><b>18</b></td><td>57</td><td>14.4</td><td>900</td><td class=\"muted\">171 · 20.2 · 2,700</td><td>10</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/brigand?lv=20\" title=\"Pick level 20\"><td><b>20</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>66</td><td>15.5</td><td>1,000</td><td class=\"muted\">198 · 21.7 · 3,000</td><td>10</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wolfden\">Wolfden</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/brigand?lv=21\" title=\"Pick level 21\"><td><b>21</b></td><td>70</td><td>16.1</td><td>1,050</td><td class=\"muted\">210 · 22.5 · 3,150</td><td>12</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wolfden\">Wolfden</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/brigand?lv=22\" title=\"Pick level 22\"><td><b>22</b></td><td>74</td><td>16.6</td><td>1,100</td><td class=\"muted\">222 · 23.2 · 3,300</td><td>2</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wolfden\">Wolfden</a></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/brigand\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>23</b></td><td>79</td><td>17.2</td><td>1,150</td><td class=\"muted\">237 · 24.1 · 3,450</td><td>7</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wolfden\">Wolfden</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"brigand\" data-map-level=\"23\">Show level 23 on the map</button>\n      <h2>Appearance</h2><p class=\"s muted\">How the game draws it. Archers and mages wear better armor as their level goes up.</p><div class=\"look-grid\"><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/9b1cfb78d1f46e754be0.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Plain</b><div class=\"g-note\">Any level</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/0e81ab2e03055fb04c81.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Archer</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 15–24 · Bearhide armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/76081a6b6cba8a6e67c9.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Mage (Fire)</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 15–24 · Snakeskin armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/a9228150422aac9a6b04.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Mage (Ice)</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 15–24 · Snakeskin armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/9b1cfb78d1f46e754be0.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Warrior</b><div class=\"g-note\">Any level</div></div></div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 9 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 24 recorded drops, 670 total, 13–77 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×13–77</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bolt\" title=\"Bolt - in 3 of 9 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 14 total, 3–7 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b4362887a1f8d7b3462f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bolt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/3<br>×3–7</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"potato-seeds\" title=\"Potato Seeds - in 2 of 9 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 4 total, 2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/49e00cfee81da1a5b775.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Potato Seeds</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/5<br>×2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"arrow\" title=\"Arrow - in 1 of 9 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 5 total, 5 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/f8e0f872cc502e1dabe7.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Arrow</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/9<br>×5</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+5 more\">+5 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bandit-boots\" title=\"Bandit Boots - in 1 of 9 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/9dd2db2b8fc51fb829fa.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bandit Boots</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/9<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"feathered-cap-green\" title=\"Feathered Cap Green - in 1 of 9 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/79007a374862508e9d7f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Feathered Cap Green</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/9<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"silver-spear\" title=\"Silver Spear - in 1 of 9 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b463ce049563b7e0bed6.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Silver Spear</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/9<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Superior: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"mana-potion-medium\" title=\"Mana Potion Medium - in 1 of 9 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/dce7b61a763deccad88f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mana Potion Medium</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/9<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bandit-tally-book\" title=\"Bandit Tally Book - in 1 of 9 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a4076cb7ec0ed13633d5.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bandit Tally Book</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/9<br>×1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>Bandit Hole</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 35</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-92\">Layout</button></li><li><b>Bandit Cave</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 18</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-71\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-3408.6px,-1100.0px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/12/3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:3072px;top:768px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/12/4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:3072px;top:1024px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/13/3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:3328px;top:768px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/13/4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:3328px;top:1024px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/14/3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:3584px;top:768px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/14/4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:3584px;top:1024px\"><i style=\"left:3514.5px;top:1076.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:3431.8px;top:1076.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:3478.8px;top:1059.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:3492.7px;top:1112.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:342